\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Complete Simulink model of active suspension system showing all subsystems: Road Input, Tire Dynamics, Unsprung Mass Dynamics, Sprung Mass Dynamics, Suspension Dynamics, PID Controller, and actuator limits}}{10}{figure.caption.5}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Passive suspension system response to step road input showing: (top to bottom) sprung mass dynamics, suspension travel, body acceleration, and tire deflection. Note the sustained oscillations and higher peak values.}}{11}{figure.caption.6}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Active suspension system response to step road input showing: (top to bottom) sprung mass dynamics, suspension travel, body acceleration, and tire deflection. Note the reduced oscillations and faster settling time compared to passive system.}}{12}{figure.caption.7}%
